  "rtfx" : 8.253697252060693,
  "segments" : [
    {
      "end" : 25.059999465942383,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 23.940000534057617,
      "text" : "Um, you don't have to."
    },
    {
      "end" : 30.040000915527344,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 29.899999618530273,
      "text" : "Yes."
    },
    {
      "end" : 34.040000915527344,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 32.900001525878906,
      "text" : "Sorry if I have to say."
    },
    {
      "end" : 34.599998474121094,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 34.380001068115234,
      "text" : "Yes."
    },
    {
      "end" : 40.47999954223633,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 39.91999816894531,
      "text" : "How's your turn?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 120.9000015258789,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 117.83999633789062,
      "text" : "Now we're developing remote control which you probably already know."
    },
    {
      "end" : 157.52000427246094,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 148.6999969482422,
      "text" : "work. What needs need to be fulfilled by the product, what effect the product has to have, and how it's"
    },
    {
      "end" : 177.54000854492188,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 170.22000122070312,
      "text" : "Okay, right. We're going to practice with the pens, and draw our favourite animal on the"
    },
    {
      "end" : 183.3800048828125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 180,
      "text" : "and some of the characteristics of that third one."
    },
    {
      "end" : 295.8800048828125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 293.82000732421875,
      "text" : "Maybe you can guess what I'm going to make."
    },
    {
      "end" : 325.4800109863281,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 314.20001220703125,
      "text" : "Okay, I see it as one thing. It's very supportive. It's your best friend in your..."
    },
    {
      "end" : 358.08001708984375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 356.4800109863281,
      "text" : "Please leave me a space at the bottom."
    },
    {
      "end" : 383.6600036621094,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 380.70001220703125,
      "text" : "change what it was originally, because that looks like a beak."
    },
    {
      "end" : 396.82000732421875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 395.9000244140625,
      "text" : "It can be a crocodile."
    },
    {
      "end" : 399.32000732421875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 398.02001953125,
      "text" : "But it was, it was, it was,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 401.7400207519531,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 399.9000244140625,
      "text" : "firstly it was an attempt at T-Rex."
    },
    {
      "end" : 405.29998779296875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 402.05999755859375,
      "text" : "and then it sort of changed into a pelican, but it can be perfect."
    },
    {
      "end" : 423.9800109863281,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 421.2200012207031,
      "text" : "Yeah, and I'll have to think on the spot on."
    },
    {
      "end" : 490.05999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 488.3599853515625,
      "text" : "It's not a vampire bad, is it?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 521.8200073242188,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 521.0999755859375,
      "text" : "They're independent."
    },
    {
      "end" : 524.0399780273438,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 523.1599731445312,
      "text" : "Did you say they're good at golf?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 524.47998046875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 524.3400268554688,
      "text" : "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "end" : 525.7000122070312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 525.219970703125,
      "text" : "Eagle."
    },
    {
      "end" : 563.6199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 562.5399780273438,
      "text" : "That was fun."
    },
    {
      "end" : 573.5599975585938,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 572.1599731445312,
      "text" : "that is in pounds at all."
    },
    {
      "end" : 590.8400268554688,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 590.4400024414062,
      "text" : "- I"
    },
    {
      "end" : 594.97998046875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 590.8400268554688,
      "text" : "think so. I'd be able to pull it up or I could put it in the share folder."
    },
    {
      "end" : 599.6400146484375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 595.2999877929688,
      "text" : "- Having said that, if you want to get one of those, the ones on the market at the moment,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 654.5800170898438,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 654.4400024414062,
      "text" : "Yeah,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 655.260009765625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 655.2000122070312,
      "text" : "yeah."
    },
    {
      "end" : 660.1799926757812,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 655.6699829101562,
      "text" : "I don't think we have to, I don't think it's a case of worrying about different languages"
    },
    {
      "end" : 704.7999877929688,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 702.6900024414062,
      "text" : "But that was quite good, the fact that you could--"
    },
    {
      "end" : 707.780029296875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 706.1599731445312,
      "text" : "- You didn't have six remote controls"
    },
    {
      "end" : 711.4400024414062,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 711.3800048828125,
      "text" : "- Yeah."
    },
    {
      "end" : 737.0399780273438,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 735.02001953125,
      "text" : "Yeah, that's the main stuff anyway."
    },
    {
      "end" : 739.5399780273438,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 737.3499755859375,
      "text" : "I mean, and you don't want to,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 742.4199829101562,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 739.5700073242188,
      "text" : "I hate looking at a control,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 747.4600219726562,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 743,
      "text" : "and seeing a million tiny little buttons with tiny little words saying what they all do and"
    },
    {
      "end" : 822.5399780273438,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 817.219970703125,
      "text" : "My granddad can answer his mobile phone, but he couldn't even dream of texting or something"
    },
    {
      "end" : 823.1199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 822.6199951171875,
      "text" : "like that."
    },
    {
      "end" : 826.8599853515625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 823.3800048828125,
      "text" : "Can he program his remote control or is he basic with that too?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 893.6199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 885.2000122070312,
      "text" : "Yeah, I don't know how for€25 or€12.50 how much of an excellent screen you could get."
    },
    {
      "end" : 922.280029296875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 913.8400268554688,
      "text" : "What about a dual function, in that you've got the basic buttons just for your play volume programs,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 970.9199829101562,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 970.7200317382812,
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "end" : 976.0400390625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 973.4000244140625,
      "text" : "Right, okay, we've got half an hour before the next meeting,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 982.8599853515625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 980.9000244140625,
      "text" : "I think that's probably about it,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 986.9000244140625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 985.6600341796875,
      "text" : "And I get to do another."
    },
    {
      "end" : 1014.0999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 1010.0999755859375,
      "text" : "You can still have plastic and it looks quite good."
    }
  ],
